/scwrcy.jpg"}, {"id": 1528451, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwrcz.jpg"}], "slug": "the-witches-whisk", "summary": "Manage a magical bakery with your witches' whisk \u2014 which doubles as a wand!\n\nBake pastries, cakes, cookies, and more by casting spells and enchantments to complete orders for your hungry customers. In the Witches' Whisk, you'll play as a witch who owns a bakery. You'll be tasked with bakery management, challenging spell casting, recipe unlocking, decorating desserts and more.\n\nIn addition, you will be able to build and upgrade your bakery, including decorating the layout and earning new spells along the way to help you take your recipes even further! You'll be able to decorate your baked goods in fun ways that are unique to your style that you can re-use later. Speaking of style... you will be able to create and customize your own character in this magical journey.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/the-witches-whisk", "videos": [{"id": 149741, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "C6l1P4iKxeE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C6l1P4iKxeE", "title": "The Witches Whisk  - DreamHack Atlanta Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/C6l1P4iKxeE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 186311, "name": "Dev Diary", "video_id": "xbX6CtTTWqs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xbX6CtTTWqs", "title": "Draw, Draw, Pass! - Official Women-Led Update Trailer | Women-Led Games x SGF 2026", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/xbX6CtTTWqs/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}